sure chest and hairy creatur by Daniel Utz #636\r\n  + E070 extras-openmoji Bluesky by @agriyakhetarpal #557\r\n  + E1DA extras-openmoji \"ai hand\" by @artlung Joe Crawford #561\r\n  + 20E3 extras-openmoji combining enclosing keycap by @nataliakeniganti #565\r\n  + E420 to E435 extras-openmoji 🏳️‍🌈 Queer symbols by @felifluid Feli Berner #588\r\n  + E06F extras-openmoji facetime by @nataliakeniganti #638\r\n  + E06E extras-openmoji ecosia browser by @nataliakeniganti #638\r\n  + Chess pieces by @nataliakeniganti #605\r\n  + Yucatan and Queretaro flag @memburg #596\r\n  + Ontario and Queretaro flag by @jj-marr #627 #628\r\n\r\nImprovements:\r\n  * Fixing Japanese emoji and correcting legibility issues: 1F21A 🈚,\r\n    1F22F 🈯, 1F23A 🈺, 1F201 🈁, 1F202 🈂, 1F232 🈲, 1F233 🈳, 1F234 🈴,\r\n    1F235 🈵, 1F236 🈶, 1F237 🈷, 1F238 🈸, 1F239 🈹, 1F250 🉐, 1F251 🉑,\r\n    3299 ㊙, 3297 ㊗ by @cemoon95 #609\r\n  * Big general overhaul of symbols by @cemoon95 #616\r\n  * Emoji 17.0 changes\r\n    Moved extras-openmoji/landslide E09D > 1F6D8 by @nataliakeniganti #624\r\n    Moved extras-openmoji/orca E005 > 1FACD by @nataliakeniganti #624\r\n  * 270D better fingers of drawing hand by Daniel Utz\r\n  * 1F383 removed unnecessary points by @yukal #555\r\n  * font/README.md: easy font usage via jsdelivr.com by @jjb #570\r\n  * Improved South Korean flag by @cemoon95 #632\r\n  * Improved 😲😧😞 by @nataliakeniganti #631\r\n\r\nFix:\r\n  * Updates flag sequences of non rendering extras-openmoji/flags by @SoSeDiK #600\r\n    Berber Flag to use [ZWJ] between characters\r\n    True South Flag to use 🏳 + [VS-16] + [ZWJ]+ 🧊 + [ZWJ] + 💎\r\n    Browncoat Flag and colored Deep Flags to use RGI emoji versions of characters (⚑ -> 🏴, ★ -> ⭐)\r\n    non-waving White Flag to use 🏳 + [VS-16] + [ZWJ]+ ⬜\r\n  * Alabama & Washington DC flag codepoints by @SoSeDiK #639\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hfg-gmuend/openmoji/releases/312589245/reactions","total_count":31,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":12,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":3,"eyes":1}}